            "review_text": "Wingc633\nHong Kong, China2070 contributions\n0\nDisappointing\nMay 2019 • Friends\nI went there on 25 May 2019. I went there because I wanted to try it's Dim Sum, most of the comments were very good but honestly I felt it was over rated after my visit. I am a Cantonese, I have tried numerous Dim Sum in Hong Kong and other area. \nThe quality of food was average or even worse than a food stall in a market in Hong Kong. \nThe service was good and the price was not expensive.\nI know it is unfair to compare the Din Sum with Hong Kong but it emphasis that it is Kong Kong style.\nIt open only in the morning, many local goes there.\nIt is no harm to try but do not expect so high.\nThe total amount of my bill was around 300k VND.\nRead more\nWritten May 26, 2019",
