            "review_title": "Review at Tien Phat Dim Sum Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Jason P\nSunnyvale, California49 contributions\n0\nAwesome Dim Sum spot in HCMC, the BEST service I ever received in a Dim Sum restaurant\nOct 2018\nCame here around 11 AM and place was not that busy.\nRestaurant has a nice decor and tables are nicely placed.\nAll of the dim sum dishes come in smaller sizes compared to ones from the Bay Area.\nThis is a good thing because you can actually taste them. I found ones from US with too much skin on the dumplings and just too big. Food is definitely legit and authentic. Food in Vietnam is already awesome but they even do dimsum better.\nNow, the service.\nThe best I have ever received in a Chinese restaurant.\nWaitstaff were attentive, friendly, knowledgeable...and spoke English.\nBy the way, this is also one of the cleanest Chinese restaurant I've ever been to. \nSo, there you have it.\nIf you had enough pho, bahn mi, com tam, or other Vietnamese dishes and want to try something else, this is definitely worth a trip down to Chinatown HCMC.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 19, 2018",
