            "review_text": "vish195\nAstana, Kazakhstan23 contributions\n0\nTasty and fresh\nJul 2018 • Family\nThe location of the restaurant is great ....at the heart of China town, this is my second visit to the place and still this restaurant amazes me with new taste from freshly made dumplings. Yes you have to ready that your food will be served late and to climb the stairs upto floor 3 because it gets busy on weekends for obvious reasons.\nOne of the other reason that I love the place is that the restaurant kept the core values of Chinese taste and traditions including the decor of the place with a reasonable pricing on the food items (very reasonable comparing to other Chinese restaurants)\n\nGreatly recommended\nRead more\nWritten August 6, 2018",
